From: termux <termux@localhost>
Subject: [PATCH 6/6] meson: disable optional libudev for Bionic builds

The wrapper enables Mesa's Linux WSI on Bionic, but Termux does not ship
libudev.  The Vulkan WSI code has no udev requirement when HAVE_LIBUDEV is
unset, so do not let Meson turn an optional build-time discovery into a
runtime dependency.

diff --git a/meson.build b/meson.build
index c546461ec9c..7a993aa2f22 100644
--- a/meson.build
+++ b/meson.build
@@ -1690,7 +1690,7 @@ if dep_libdrm.found()
   endif
 endif
 
-dep_libudev = dependency('libudev', required : false)
+dep_libudev = null_dep
 if dep_libudev.found()
   pre_args += '-DHAVE_LIBUDEV'
 endif
